              </div>
              <span class="text-primary-500 font-bold text-xl">$75.000</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-secondary-50 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow duration-300">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-4">
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-secondary-900 mb-2">Tradicional (La Acadé)</h3>
                <p class="text-secondary-800">Para 5 o 6 personas</p>
                <p class="text-secondary-800">2 Chorizos, 2 Morcillas, Riñón, Chinchulín, Asado y Pollo</p>
              </div>
              <span class="text-primary-500 font-bold text-xl">$95.000</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-secondary-50 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow duration-300">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-4">
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-secondary-900 mb-2">Especial (El Millo)</h3>
                <p class="text-secondary-800">Para 5 o 6 personas</p>
                <p class="text-secondary-800">2 Chorizos, 2 Morcillas, Riñón, Chinchulín, Asado, Pollo, Molleja y 2 Provoletas</p>
              </div>
              <span class="text-primary-500 font-bold text-xl">$128.000</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-secondary-50 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow duration-300">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-4">
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-secondary-900 mb-2">Super Norma (El Arse)</h3>
                <p class="text-secondary-800">Para 4 personas.</p>
                <p class="text-secondary-800">2 Chorizos, 1 Morcilla, Riñón, Chinchulín, Molleja, Asado, Pollo, Cerdo, 2 Provoletas, 2 Bebidas a elección, 2 Porciones de Fritas, una Ensalada a elección y 4 Postres a elección</p>
              </div>
              <span class="text-primary-500 font-bold text-xl">$140.000</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-secondary-50 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow duration-300">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-4">
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-secondary-900 mb-2">Tradicional (El Cuervo)</h3>
                <p class="text-secondary-800">Para 7 a 8 personas</p>
                <p class="text-secondary-800">3 Chorizos, 3 Morcillas, Riñón, Chinchulín, Asado y Pollo</p>
              </div>
              <span class="text-primary-500 font-bold text-xl">$135.000</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-secondary-50 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow duration-300">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-4">
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-secondary-900 mb-2">Especial (El Taladro)</h3>
